# local reference checkout of nutanixservices/ztf-internal-scripts
# (entity-catalog maintainer pipeline, verification scripts, UAT scenarios)
.external/

# local-only symlink into .external/ztf-internal-scripts/workflow -- keeps the
# entity-catalog maintainer's tracked iteration state (decisions.yml, baseline.json,
# manual_entities.yml, etc.) out of this public repo while still resolving under
# this checkout's path for the workflow.entity_catalog CLI (--project-root .)
